  "id": "blueberry-buttermilk-coffee-cake",
  "name": "Blueberry Buttermilk Coffee Cake",
  "subtitle": "A tender cake with blueberries and a buttery crumb topping.",
  "description": "A lightly sweet buttermilk cake layered with blueberries and finished with a simple crumb topping.",
